      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it guaranteed that if \"VendorIdSource\" exists in Floss, then \"SdpDiVendorIdSource\" will also exist for all these instances? For example, will a newly paired classic device in Floss only have the Sdp* versions of these and therefore we miss it in the migration from Floss-\u003eBlueZ?",
      "revId": "0bd3f19d43cdbe4407d1ab5322e3c6dbb314d1c3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d0ca5d26_8e3f2483",
        "filename": "system/gd/rust/linux/mgmt/src/migrate.rs",
        "patchSetId": 3
